{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女星「雞排妹」鄭家純曾經歷不幸流產的低潮，終於在今年四月再次迎來喜訊，喜悅宣布懷上雙胞胎。</p><p>準備升格為「雙寶媽」的她，經常在社群大方分享孕期點滴。進入孕晚期的她也在社群曬出最新的巨肚照，絕佳狀態也引起網友熱議。</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171498293721567232275830.jpeg/0HEuu3UYnhZQy2LFMm3Ev8O0nVIleD205yW49-cluPc\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）</figcaption></figure><p>鄭家純懷孕31週　肚圍破百四肢竟零贅肉</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171498994585571328572680.jpeg/TldR49UsoArXFOoF-tfqjzetQvid-Xhf7oiiy-6Ioss\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（Instagram@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171498996947095552359210.jpeg/ImNxM6LtodbtSdan6CcE4A1boFq2tli0WVgIv1lYCL8\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（Instagram@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171498999002435584982410.jpeg/Z786TACGI9X2k5CyjVbgBK708uzHl9sXBO3tTATt7Uw\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（Facebook@鄭家純）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250511/998270028333715456580764.png/7vuJl1RUOl_O5IVVRgFWr6BWFy5tA234Y6tFF2OrRRc\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雞排妹鄭家純（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250511/998264566485880832489035.png/cfPnoUqton5ArqkCeaj6iVSuiUGp-A2eY2jUKGNo1Cg\"/><figcaption>雞排妹鄭家純（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418613807616000124976.jpeg/F2yycmXeQO1D2cPmiVNqmRewogj7pR3sTVuvXk1br14\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418614483030016624579.jpeg/bp3GTpf8-DowxBBfJJmezAfiwLLmUnSpWWlRbllpUW4\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption><