kTgfxcaCdReDCvheYmFZex5eFR3tpuUd7abk\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418612171837440708951.jpeg/5y1EaCnL0jAwD0nHtDdUKD4DyLTA8R1Keh81h3ofNYc\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418610703699968465029.jpeg/IUtEIXHz0viPIlZN8chgBau6UQozLi5jpXlBb6V5QW8\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418610905157632951246.jpeg/c8mMKvB8TaoIqsa9VxbIkxspdW6TkKnnmTyERZk8hEU\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418610795974656092571.jpeg/3Ad7maVCgE4aOO_iblmIhxWJqBXc-3ovXDKVlVwylZU\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418609919365120463190.jpeg/mNOurIvFKu3g01AeJVuPx_yMKCPcK7pVU-fIK1PnyCs\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418611915853824516349.jpeg/47TSQGAHbLSSbJl_yz7CtDuJFXJhXYKJHlF69h5RevY\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418607343800320938027.jpeg/4c12dvvBP1qbe13VuAyQT83S0Mux18i-jaHc6Y2h3Ok\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418608916795392942578.jpeg/wx_LcYsodyw--HlfRG4jrZg3yjMOVj8tRuW8Z0blvGc\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418608199569408352197.jpeg/pvYFclMM74zAevsIUXIZ0wLqGnNg87SFQFZoDkBWaA4\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418605854822400941765.jpeg/7RpBUUg9QRSqZiPuCjzop14u9y9fwqcMVYOCAFWDggA\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418607012450304280951.jpeg/ulD-sCnSZYTIWbOuwh05j-4KpTx15y1cSGv4P0hr-D8\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418609336225792463205.jpeg/IyqyCHfvmA60mLxGziP7Re5liVzpps3PLr0tuy69Lbs\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418606702202880980367.jpeg/tSYuR6DDgQKA6AD9g9nH0yC6jjD-9w-N3zCP3N8wj9w\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418608770125824749528.jpeg/Eo2f9UtVlcCfMChDkuezUVXLToBbiZDHlbEQt5WxELc\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954418606836289536915748.jpeg/G0coNrlMkEXuZZ9q7z0TcWhZ_H64IGSvnPHpZpzx6WY\"/><figcaption>鄭家純（雞排妹）（IG@ili.cheng）</figcaption></figure><p>從鄭家純上傳的限時動態可見，她隨性將長髮披肩、對鏡自拍。身穿淡色運動內衣搭配黑色貼身褲，大方展現整顆渾圓光滑的巨肚，完美記錄下珍貴的孕期姿態。</p><p>鄭家純也在圖片中寫下「31w1d肚圍101cm」，透露目前已經進入懷孕第31週，肚圍更是突破101cm。不過鄭家純整體體態維持得相當得宜，除了孕肚光滑緊緻外，依舊保持白皙膚色與纖細四肢，狀態令人稱羨。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：陳妍希減少拍戲遭疑「湊仔荒廢事業」親回擊：沒什麼能排兒子前面】台灣女星陳妍希自從升格人母後，近年來將不少重心轉向家庭，陪伴 9 歲兒子「小星星」成長。然而，這樣的選擇卻引來部分網友的質疑，認為她因此「荒廢了演藝事業」。（IG@yanxi531）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168603721089683456209415.jpeg/cKctzZONtDtZPA--MAiFFvmYGsIt5PuzREJMrERCTKw\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：陳妍希減少拍戲遭疑「湊仔荒廢事業」親回擊：沒什麼能排兒子前面】台灣女星陳妍希自從升格人母後，近年來將不少重心轉向家庭，陪伴 9 歲兒子「小星星」成長。然而，這樣的選擇卻引來部分網友的質疑，認為她因此「荒廢了演藝事業」。（IG@yanxi531）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希曬兒子小星星正面照。（微博@陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139510502842437632218369.jpeg/Yhmyy-eEZtuo77zR31bSm2PQR6n6s7g6kS7OpJEuzqQ\"/><figcaption>陳妍希曬兒子小星星正面照。（微博@陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"早前聖誕節，陳妍希亦有曬出兒子照片。（微博@陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139511177533984768380297.jpeg/R5MJ3nfgs0amf8yWHAlq0tjg0-iVjys_YRtM0WEbTNE\"/><figcaption>早前聖誕節，陳妍希亦有曬出兒子照片。（微博@陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「小星星」如今身高已到陳妍希肩膀處。（抖音@月月孟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139511317174947840136749.jpeg/n4q-5x1lMZ6uBSx7FxAmgT1H9yxXENGCFRnIahUZyGo\"/><figcaption>「小星星」如今身高已到陳妍希肩膀處。（抖音@月月孟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小星星似足爸爸陳曉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139511731563925504074823.jpeg/R9l1QEf0u4MdE-X_RKqUSG82xk0YaHWz6YmvUemJr1E\"/><figcaption>小星星似足爸爸陳曉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小星星似足爸爸陳曉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139511729022046208462987.jpeg/TkUs0BdOf3MQ8-YxPDli8lkcgjISrjjq1vWr5Nb1q-Q\"/><figcaption>小星星似足爸爸陳曉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小星星傳出轉校。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250225/971122999904178176026189.jpeg/Vl1rIi3_eAqY-LR76kkMaa7QVRAPxTXnkF-6ZZBfumU\"/><figcaption>小星星傳出轉校。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165982022611505152642150.jpeg/CGFyZKqiZoMcewI5ZxUYHbrtpafrwLAUL6N01i-jdNY\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（小紅書@陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250731/1027636252683276288681570.jpeg/r7faLQlfbtvqzkOtjjL8jyttCcC_65R038hU_t_IVP4\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（小紅書@陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（小紅書@陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250731/1027635967383048192517803.png/0RhVg4yzPkCqq-PD0UhYO3or2Awcx-yP3W4V1N1uFdQ\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（小紅書@陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2025年5月，陳妍希《親愛的仇敵》開播。（《親愛的仇敵》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250516/1000010882719158272027819.png/NnCBBtecmtZnkXWpFxJRpfoY7c9RWWXmjaCl_Y2gpf0\"/><figcaption>2025年5月，陳妍希《親愛的仇敵》開播。（《親愛的仇敵》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希和周柯宇2025年12月播出新劇《狙擊蝴蝶》廣受好評。（陳妍希微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260106/1085181517824528384014589.jpeg/FtSAQ8x_ZTvVloG-B4aTbtmX30C5MUO5Y3acamN2nGo\"/><figcaption>陳妍希和周柯宇2025年12月播出新劇《狙擊蝴蝶》廣受好評。（陳妍希微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉與陳妍希已於2025年2月官宣離婚。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251226/1081171150370770944659017.jpeg/xSBasSxsi6kvxiKrJ93DSx53Iw-C8e-jcEuEiXBLhIk\"/><figcaption>陳曉與陳妍希已於2025年2月官宣離婚。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希與陳曉在頭紗親吻經典一幕。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250218/968525585364291584983715.jpeg/lXLFv1G1lXONUDI3bxo7JYqNxQEL0UC1bASeHmwEnh4\"/><figcaption>陳妍希與陳曉在頭紗親吻經典一幕。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（IG@yanxi531）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250218/968532934816436224359842.jpeg/K7UXJ5c_zdnS7EHMYcHMai-wwuhKrDvv2dc489nXOPM\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（IG@yanxi531）</figcaption></figure><p>「五金歌王」蕭煌奇拚浪潮音樂大賞　9月6日親登舞台獻唱掀高潮</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T15:38:41.373597+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1534,"images":47,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}